# The archive on pub.dev is what a consumer downloads, so it carries the library
# and the things that document it — not the test suite, which is 16 KB of fixture
# nobody installing this package will run.
#
# `analysis_options.yaml` deliberately STAYS in the archive: pub.dev runs
# `dart analyze` against what it received, and dropping the file would have it
# score the package under rules the package was never written against.
test/
doc/
